   "note": "Not walkable on purpose: agents must not path through the shop. The keeper is placed here directly. The counter front is not in occluder.png, and the owner has deferred it: how much of a body the counter hides depends on whether that body is standing or seated, and on where it stands, so a single painted mask may not be the right answer. Revisit once sprites are actually being placed here. Until then the keeper renders full height in front of the counter."
